      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Introduce a lightweight overlay manager so only one top-level overlay (tour, modal, scrim) is visible at a time; queue the rest. Fixes F-2/F-5 and the Esc-inconsistency N-7."
    },
    {
