      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "UIA InvokePattern clicks work for nav/native actions but not Electron DOM handlers; CDP el.click() is the reliable DOM trigger. UIA tree = what is visible/accessible; CDP = what happens when a handler fires."
